{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dictation is a roguelike made for people who love word related games, where you'll have to build words from scratch based on your perks to reach the maximum amount of points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt the difficulty to your own playstyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the difficulty of the next level based on the strategy you plan to follow, adjusting the number of submits, changes, or the score scale in that level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873530/extras/5e1dc80575dfa5d8e9b03149907c58a3.poster.avif?t=1760311135\" width=780 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873530/extras/5e1dc80575dfa5d8e9b03149907c58a3.webm?t=1760311135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873530/extras/5e1dc80575dfa5d8e9b03149907c58a3.mp4?t=1760311135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your combos and scale them</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to make your perks work with the words you're trying to build \u2014 there are plenty of perks to create combos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+50 perks with unique habilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 letters to build your words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different levels plus an infinite mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873530/extras/c847499a6586c7e11dbd5c755530e3ae.avif?t=1760311135\" width=900 height=250 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873530?t=1760311135","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873530?t=1760311135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873530/dedc556386587bd5ee94c297f187baa0a14e8f05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760311135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873530/dedc556386587bd5ee94c297f187baa0a14e8f05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760311135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3919830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dictation is a roguelike made for people who love word related games, where you'll have to build words from scratch based on your perks to reach the maximum amount of points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt the difficulty to your own playstyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the difficulty of the next level based on the strategy you plan to follow, adjusting the number of submits, changes, or the score scale in that level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873530/extras/5e1dc80575dfa5d8e9b03149907c58a3.poster.avif?t=1760311135\" width=780 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873530/extras/5e1dc80575dfa5d8e9b03149907c58a3.we